{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46926","headline":"过陆鸿渐旧居 · 齐己","name":"过陆鸿渐旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚客西来过旧居，读碑寻传见终初。\n佯狂未必轻儒业，高尚何妨诵佛书。\n种竹岸香连菡萏，煮茶泉影落蟾蜍。\n如今若更生来此，知有何人赠白驴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}